OL,3,ARyanair boss O'Leary defends 'high-fare
OL,4,Arapists' airlines remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyanair chief executive Michael O'Leary
OL,7,Fhas refused to apologise to a rape
OL,8,Fcrisis centre which criticised him for
OL,9,Fdescribing rival airlines as "high-fare
OL,10,Frapists".
OL,12,FSpeaking to journalists, O'Leary said
OL,13,Fsome people were "desperate to get to
OL,14,FRyanair's low fares because they can't
OL,15,Fafford to fly with the high-fare
OL,16,Frapists around Europe".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
