OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARyanair boss O'Leary defends 'high-fare
OL,4,Arapists' airlines remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Leary doubled-down on his choice of
OL,7,Fwords when asked about them at the
OL,8,Ftime, and later refused to apologise
OL,9,Fwhen the Dublin Rape Crisis Centre
OL,10,F(DRCC) wrote to him asking for apology,
OL,11,Fin a letter seen by the BBC.
OL,13,FIreland's deputy premier Simon Harris
OL,14,Fsaid it was "clearly an inappropriate
OL,15,Fuse of language" and that O'Leary
OL,16,F"should have moved to rectify it".
